message: "If you use UTA (Uncertainty Transformation Analysis) in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "UTA v1: Uncertainty Transformation Analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: "Pitre"
    given-names: "Martin"
version: "1.2"
date-released: "2026-07-13"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >
  UTA (Uncertainty Transformation Analysis) is a framework for examining
  how uncertainty changes over time through resolution, complexity,
  surprise, and memory effects. Version 1.2 represents the baseline
  theory used during the initial UTA pilot study.
keywords:
  - uncertainty
  - uncertainty analysis
  - decision science
  - citizen science
  - research framework
